# MP — *Marchantia polymorpha* bundle

## Status

**Assembled** — TIER1/TIER2/TIER3 populated; pending validation against MP
LC-MS/MS data.

## Species information

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| Organism | *Marchantia polymorpha* |
| Clade | Bryophyte (liverwort) |
| Relevance | Model for basal land-plant epigenetics |

## Known sequence differences vs. AT / human

Key substitutions identified from preliminary MSA:

- H3 27-40: **KSAPSTGGVKKPHR** (differs from both human KSAPATGGVKKPHR
  and AT H3.3 KSAPTTGGVKKPHR)
- H4 20-23: **KVFR** (instead of human/AT KVLR)
- Additional variants pending full MSA characterisation

## Bundle contents

| Directory | Files | Description |
|-----------|-------|-------------|
| `src/TIER1/` | 72 | Upstream EpiProfile 2.0 basic (unchanged) |
| `src/TIER2/` | 10 | Modified: init_histone0 + DrawISOProfile1 + robustness |
| `src/TIER3/` | 10 | AT-derived + MP-specific (H3_14_27_40, H4_02v_20_23) |

## Running

```matlab
cd bundles/MP/src
EpiProfile
```

See `docs/tiers.md` for tier definitions.
